    (description) 007 First Light is IO Interactive's reimagined origin story for a younger, rougher James Bond. A confident magpie of a game, it borrows openly from Max Payne 3's dual-wielding gunplay, Control's cold brutalist interiors, and Splinter Cell: Chaos Theory's patient stealth — and though it lands a notch below each inspiration (and never fully escapes the Hitman skeleton beneath it), the sum is a genuinely great time, peaking in its open-ended License to Kill firefights.

